<div class="faq-list">
<details class="faq-item" data-reveal="">
<summary>Is Swishtag a Shopify agency or a software company?</summary>
<p>
              Both, with a clear distinction. Company Store, SAGE, Enterprise Automation, and PunchOut are solution paths.
              Promo Plus, Xecutor, and Rocket Apps are Swishtag owned software platforms.
            </p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item" data-reveal="">
<summary>What is the difference between Solutions and Enterprise Commerce?</summary>
<p>
              Solutions focuses on launching or improving customer facing stores. Enterprise Commerce
              connects the more complex work behind those stores, including suppliers, procurement, ERP,
              accounting, multi store management, and automation.
            </p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item" data-reveal="">
<summary>Do we need to replace commonsku, SAGE, ESP+, or our ERP?</summary>
<p>
              No. Swishtag is designed to add a modern commerce and automation layer around the systems your
              team already trusts. We focus on connecting the gaps rather than forcing a rip and replace project.
            </p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item" data-reveal="">
<summary>What is PunchOut Solutions?</summary>
<p>
              PunchOut Solutions helps promotional products distributors launch and manage PunchOut catalog
              connections using Shopify. It can support multiple buyer connections on one Shopify store or
              connections across multiple Shopify stores from one management platform.
            </p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item" data-reveal="">
<summary>Can you migrate existing company stores to Shopify?</summary>
<p>
              Yes. Swishtag can migrate products, customers, content, workflows, and store rules from legacy,
              custom, WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, and other commerce environments.
            </p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item" data-reveal="">
<summary>Who are Swishtag solutions built for?</summary>
<p>
              Swishtag is focused on promotional product distributors, suppliers, and decorators. The strongest
              fit is an organization trying to launch more programs, connect existing systems, or scale without
              adding the same amount of manual work.
            </p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item" data-reveal="">
<summary>How does a project begin?</summary>
<p>
              We begin by understanding your current customer journey, systems, workflows, and operational
              bottlenecks. From there, we recommend the smallest practical path that can create meaningful progress.
            </p>
</details>
